019s a catch\u2026\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Do NOT trust the labels! The only thing that matters is the color of the sign. Make a mistake, and your boss might take more than just your paycheck...\n\n\ud83d\udc80 Can you survive the job?\n\nTest your reaction time and focus in an increasingly fast-paced challenge.\nExperience a mix of dark humor and horror in a thrilling VR experience.\nWork under pressure as the conveyor speeds up and the boss keeps a close eye on you.\nPlay it safe, or your time in Vampire\u2019s Factory will be very short\u2026", "short_description": "\ud83d\udd25 Work for a vampire... or become his next meal! You've been hired to sort blood in this eerie factory. But be careful\u2014one mistake might cost you much more than your job... \ud83e\ude78\ud83e\udd87"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://khargooshstudios.weebly.com/privacypolicyvf.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "JRad Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://khargooshstudios.weebly.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9468367673239544"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4225365487787055"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4322400754668456"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2170564486